      "machineHash": "8d56d2509d7dbdcdc567a9ee52d475ea877c818f6b524dcbfd92be0b9c0af921",
      "machineText": "Wails 建置系統是一套靈活且強大的工具，旨在簡化 Wails 應用程式的建置流程。它採用工作執行器[Task](https://taskfile.dev)，讓您能輕鬆定義及執行工作。雖然 v3 建置系統是預設選項，但 Wails 鼓勵「自備工具」的做法，讓開發人員可依需求自訂建置流程。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "The Wails build system is a flexible and powerful tool designed to streamline\\ the build process for…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
